            supporters: ["Cook's own race summary makes the affirmative case — that he can now turn the focus onto his opponent's record rather than an unpopular president","A 5.6-to-one advantage in money raised and $2.5 million more on hand","He has already won this district once, and cleared his primary unopposed while Democrats spent millions against each other"],
